{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ELunf4OyL31795391014.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國俄亥俄州發生槍擊案，造成三人死亡、一人受傷。警方認為事件涉及家庭糾紛。</p><p></p><p>槍擊案現場拉起封鎖線。當地警方周六晚接報，在克里夫蘭以南約16公里的一座活動中心內有槍擊案，該處正舉行一場新生嬰兒派對。其中一名在現場開槍的29歲男子被警方拘留，但未落案起訴，正調查他是首先開槍還是自衛。</p><p></p><p>另外有一名19歲槍手死亡。其餘兩名死者，分別是一名17歲少女和一名45歲男子。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.578500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:29:51.238267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:14.607032+00:00","content_hash":"8d9a2f0b582a43deb3b10bbdf793910513e622e93dc34679972f8fed565c39f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.578500+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}